OL,5,G2100 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FBrand new series: We follow South
OL,7,     FWestern paramedic crews as they
OL,8,     Ftreat a man with severe abdominal
OL,9,     Fpains and a 95-year-old man who's
OL,10,     Ffallen and injured his face.
OL,11,G2200 Police Rescue
OL,12,     FOfficers risk their lives trying
OL,13,     Fto save a man trapped under a
OL,14,     Ftrain at an inner-city railway
OL,15,     Fstation. And in Sydney's north,
OL,16,     Fthe team co-ordinate a land
OL,17,     Fsearch. (Ep5/6)
